c.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/e4/2f/17/e42f172f-64ab-6e5b-22d7-994f8250ffd9/83e17141-cd00-4ee0-8840-4239eb3c9dc0_Screenshot-6.5inch-5.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"090412\",\"textColor2\":\"312362\",\"textColor3\":\"3a3642\",\"textColor4\":\"5a4f81\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/d9/8f/97/d98f9724-cf9c-ed3f-9743-3e8b28f4d29a/78d4a640-121a-46da-a33e-dea4050694cd_Screenshot-6.5inch-6.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"090412\",\"textColor2\":\"231f2a\",\"textColor3\":\"3a3642\",\"textColor4\":\"4f4c54\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/17/5d/54/175d54d9-5d58-6a2e-1636-4fe47f7d7ead/37215ff3-9dd8-490d-972f-8e053654c59f_Screenshot-6.5inch-7.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"090412\",\"textColor2\":\"1b2e5e\",\"textColor3\":\"3a3642\",\"textColor4\":\"49587e\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/57/4b/c9/574bc977-6576-49a2-1ef3-0ed144eb20e9/f0da95a0-3590-41b2-9520-0a71a9b31cf1_Screenshot-6.5inch-8.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242},{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":2688,\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"f89d38\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"c67d2d\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/b9/69/87/b96987bf-a6f5-30d8-5ee3-3311b2473e54/ca713c04-8c4f-41e1-8af1-610f4c623e0b_Screenshot-6.5inch-9.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1242}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Join 200K+ people building life-changing habits with Evoday! Track your progress on beautiful calendars and widgets, and stay motivated to achieve your goals.\\n\\nEvoday helps you to build healthy habits, whether they are daily or weekly habits. To help you improve your life and keep you motivated, the app displays your progress on beautifully designed monthly and yearly calendars, either as grids or complete calendars (showing the months of the year). You’ll also be able to see a bunch of cool statistics for each habit, such as your current and longest streak and your yearly and all-time completion rates.\\n\\nAny great new skill requires at least a few months of practice before you begin to see solid results: learning an instrument, getting back into shape, taking up a new language, etc. Focus on doing a little bit every day, log it in the app, and within a few months you’ll start to see incredible progress.\\n\\nBuild good habits, break bad habits, and achieve greatness!\\n\\n• Practice Better\\nEvoday encourages you to practice better with its progress tracking feature. Giving up on your dreams will be harder to do when you see how long your current streaks are, and how much  practice you’ve put in so far. Visualize your progress on a yearly calendar and get reports for each habit with your current and longest streak, as well as your yearly and all-time completion rates. \\n\\n• Make your Home Screen shine with widgets\\nThe app offer a wide variety of gorgeous widgets: weekly calendar, monthly calendar, last 3 months calendar, last 20 weeks grid, etc.\\n\\n• Share Your Habits\\nShare your habits with friends, family, and followers - thanks to the beautifully designed,  pre-formatted calendar images.\\n\\n• Get Your Dopamine Rush\\nNothing quite hits like the dopamine rush you get when crossing off an item on a list. With Evoday, you can track your daily goals and feel that sweet sense of accomplishment when you reach them.\\n\\n• Your Data Is Your Data\\nWe care about your privacy. Your habits data never leave your phone or the iCloud backups of your phone. None of your habits data is ever sent to a server, except iCloud as part of your secure phone backups. When you get a new phone and restore from your previous phone (or your iCloud backup), your habits data will be there waiting for you, so you can jump right back in with ease. You can also export your data and save it wherever you want! (Files, Dropbox, Google Drive, etc.).\\n\\n• Our App Is Made For Everyone\\nWe’ve made the choice of offering most features of Evoday free of charge, forever. We want our app to be accessible to anyone and everyone, in the hopes of helping to improve your habits and your life. If you want to unlock some advanced features and track unlimited habits, an optional Premium Plan is available.\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.kevinquisquater.com/superhabit/privacy.html\\nTerms of Use: https://www.kevinquisquater.com/superhabit/terms.html\\n\\n\\nIf you have any feedback or suggestions, then we’d be more than happy to hear them! Get in touch via the app and let us know how we’re doing. \\n\\n••• About Cosmic Taps •••\\nWe are a tiny team building apps that we love to use. Check them out either by tapping on our developer name, by searching “Cosmic Taps” on the App Store, or by visiting www.cosmictaps.com\\n\\nTo a better you,\\nThe team at Cosmic Taps\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":39964672}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1403517519\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878544420\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":39964672}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1403517519\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878544420\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"http://www.kevinquisquater.com/superhabit/privacy.html\",\"releaseDate\":\"2018-08-02\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"subtitle\":\"Healthy and awesome new habits\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.evoday.com\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• On iOS 26, I’ve updated the date and time pickers to use the new glass-style background.\\n• I’ve refreshed the design of the page for selecting the first day of the week.\\n• I’ve updated the “NEW” badge on the Settings tab (shown when new release notes are available): it now appears in blue instead of red.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-30T07:52:27Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.15\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• I've added support for iOS 26 and Apple's new Liquid Glass design!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-16T08:04:19Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.14\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-12\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Fix an issue from 2025.12 where some users could not restore their subscription access. Sorry about that!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-12T18:46:55Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.13\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Reddit has approved our community! You can now read the feature requests of other users without having to download the Reddit app. And if you have an account, feel free to join the subreddit!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-11T17:13:18Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.12\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-20T14:57:08Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.11\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-10T07:58:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.10\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-04T12:02:15Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.9\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-26T09:23:55Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.8\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-21T08:36:02Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.7\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-04T07:47:19Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-16T14:50:33Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-08\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-08T15:08:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-06T21:14:18Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-03\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy 2025 everyone!\\n• EVODAY: we are really happy to announce that we have found a great new name for the app: Evoday. Tell us what you think by tapping “Contact” in the app! Your friends can find us at evoday.com\\n• First attempt at trying to fix a crash that sometimes happens when you go to the Yearly page. We are not sure yet if this will fix the issue, but are hopeful :-)\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-03T10:28:34Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-31\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-31T09:02:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2025.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-29\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy 2025 everyone!\\nThe entire team hopes you build the life you want, and that the app will play a little role in helping you reach your goals.\\n• Kevin speaking: I’ve just realized I messed up the crash reporting setup years ago —classic Kevin move. If your app was crashing, we probably had no idea unless you emailed us about it. It’s fixed now, so we’ll actually notice crashes quickly and get them sorted in time. Remember, you can always email us directly if you spot issues—we read every message.\\n• We heard that the app sometimes crashes when going from the monthly page to the Today page: with that update, we should soon receive crash reports and be able to find out what’s happening. Sorry about that.\\nThanks a lot and to an amazing New Year for you and for our team!\\nKevin, for the team at Cosmic Taps\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-29T20:34:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2024.18\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-20T09:01:00Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"2024.17\"},{\"re