---\\n1.1.5: Fixes minor bugs and added a contact form.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-03T19:26:26Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-27\",\"releaseNotes\":\"With this update, you can now keep a journal within the app to write down notes or thoughts for the day. In addition, reminders are now optional and there are more customization options for the widget.\\n-----\\n1.1.4: Fixes minor bugs\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-27T00:11:41Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"With this update, you can now keep a journal within the app to write down notes or thoughts for the day. In addition, reminders are now optional and there are more customization options for the widget.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-23T00:04:34Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-19\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Set multiple reminders for a day and be reminded at different times each day of the week.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-19T20:27:53Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Creating habits is now a little more convenient.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-05T17:43:13Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-28\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Wrapped 2021 + the smallest unit is now optional\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-28T13:14:14Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Small adjustments to the calendar and more localizations.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-04T01:13:00Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.9\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-11-10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- new: all activities for a habit can be viewed in a calendar\\n- small bug fixes and improvements\\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-11-10T22:00:58Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.8\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-it is now possible to go back when creating habits\\n-fixes a bug that caused notifications to be sent twice under certain circumstances\\n-it is now indicated if the notifications are disabled and better explained why they are needed\\n-small bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-15T15:37:37Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.7\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-07-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"In addition to the streak, there is now an option to see how many times you have already checked off a habit in total.\\nAlso fixes a small bug that causes the widget to check off the wrong day under certain circumstances.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-07-06T18:46:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixes a problem with the widget and optimizes the order\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-17T13:00:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Widgets are here! Add a widget to your home screen and never miss a habit again.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-13T16:13:42Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-the order of your habits can now be changed (long press the name and drag)\\n-German localization\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-02-06T11:37:16Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Rewards Bugfixes\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-18T18:48:13Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Added select all button on reminder page\\n-Changes to the help text of the smallest unit page\\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-17T12:16:42Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-03\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-03T23:11:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\"}],\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"websiteUrl\":\"https://onrise.me\"}},\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"id