\",\"textColor2\":\"251835\",\"textColor3\":\"3c3947\",\"textColor4\":\"463c53\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/02/af/da/02afda94-fd3b-1c25-adc6-109ab3c88e47/4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2752},{\"bgColor\":\"120f23\",\"height\":2064,\"textColor1\":\"fefefe\",\"textColor2\":\"a95cf1\",\"textColor3\":\"cfced2\",\"textColor4\":\"8b4cc8\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/07/34/b6/0734b617-c6ab-3c0d-ce70-a93a7961cfb7/5.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2752},{\"bgColor\":\"b99aed\",\"height\":2064,\"textColor1\":\"160e19\",\"textColor2\":\"0d1724\",\"textColor3\":\"372a43\",\"textColor4\":\"30314c\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/6d/25/2f/6d252f50-b72a-5ff4-2187-8c880b9808a4/6.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2752},{\"bgColor\":\"9e56e1\",\"height\":2064,\"textColor1\":\"121315\",\"textColor2\":\"141414\",\"textColor3\":\"2e203e\",\"textColor4\":\"30213d\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/de/30/16/de30168f-3635-3bd5-ee2e-2ca4c2c67657/7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2752}],\"iphone_d74\":[{\"bgColor\":\"cacbcd\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"0a1f30\",\"textColor2\":\"1a2129\",\"textColor3\":\"31414f\",\"textColor4\":\"3d434a\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/b6/33/b9/b633b9e3-5b42-b6dd-7c64-2b15b82ee393/1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"e7e8e6\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"161f22\",\"textColor2\":\"222427\",\"textColor3\":\"3f4749\",\"textColor4\":\"494b4d\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/c4/d2/95/c4d295c0-5b4f-3666-9151-3d5c82c40773/2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"adb0aa\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"15172c\",\"textColor2\":\"10192a\",\"textColor3\":\"333645\",\"textColor4\":\"2f3744\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/e5/c7/a1/e5c7a147-ea65-f862-7aa3-61bcce4c8b51/3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"020205\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"c78ef5\",\"textColor2\":\"b85af0\",\"textColor3\":\"a072c5\",\"textColor4\":\"9448c1\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/43/d5/15/43d5151a-a1a3-26cc-6f6c-10e12f0fbfab/4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"0c0e0a\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"f8fafa\",\"textColor2\":\"b85af0\",\"textColor3\":\"c9cbca\",\"textColor4\":\"954bc2\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/9d/8f/12/9d8f12e2-3cb1-c87c-1ee7-284bf18261ee/5.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"c1c2bd\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"151c39\",\"textColor2\":\"1d1c3d\",\"textColor3\":\"373d53\",\"textColor4\":\"3e3d56\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/8b/0d/8e/8b0d8ec6-d3a3-26e0-69bc-1fef7de0e3bb/6.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"e8e9e4\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"050406\",\"textColor2\":\"072236\",\"textColor3\":\"323233\",\"textColor4\":\"344959\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/2c/af/56/2caf56f4-4b54-2382-292d-6148817ef54b/7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"110e19\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"d1a3f6\",\"textColor2\":\"c270f2\",\"textColor3\":\"ab85ca\",\"textColor4\":\"9f5cc6\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/e0/34/3c/e0343c84-6694-0d89-65d3-8b6397e7befc/8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320},{\"bgColor\":\"5e91f1\",\"height\":2868,\"textColor1\":\"06060b\",\"textColor2\":\"161616\",\"textColor3\":\"172239\",\"textColor4\":\"252f42\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/1d/29/10/1d291006-d806-3719-990d-79cfcb8321b5/9.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1320}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Don't set goals, build habits.\\n\\nDo you remember the last time you wanted to achieve something? You may have started strong, but after some time, maybe you lost motivation. Here is our tip – instead of setting goals, start building your daily routines, and improving your regular habits. Small and easy changes will compound into remarkable results. With our app, you will get better every day and achieve the kind of success that lasts.\\n\\nBuild good habits, break bad ones.\\nWant to cut down on alcohol, improve your healthy habits, or be more productive? Possibilities are unlimited. Get inspiration from pre-defined templates, discover habit ideas with on-device Apple Intelligence (where available), or create your own custom habit.\\n\\nAchieve your daily, weekly, and monthly goals.\\nUsing a simple overview, you can easily manage all your goals and see your achievements. Have you overachieved your goal? You can track that too.\\n\\nTrack your progress and streaks.\\nBrowse history, check out your stats and see how you've improved over time.\\nDidn't have time to track a previous day? No problem, you can easily update any record in the past.\\n\\nFeatures:\\n- Build good habits, break bad ones\\n- Daily, weekly, and monthly goals\\n- Get habit ideas with private, on-device Apple Intelligence (where available)\\n- Track even overachieved goals\\n- Track time-based goals with timers\\n- Powerful statistics with heatmaps\\n- Habit lists\\n- Habit notes\\n- 2,500+ icons and emojis, with support for Genmoji and custom stickers\\n- Dark Mode and appearance customization\\n- Apple Health integration\\n- Reminders, app badge, and Apple Health notifications\\n- Interactive widgets for Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode\\n- Interactive Dynamic Island \u0026 Live Activities\\n- Control Center widgets\\n- Apple Watch complications and the Smart Stack widget\\n- Export to a CSV file\\n- Siri Shortcuts\\n- iCloud backup \u0026 sync\\n- Available on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://www.awesome-habits.com/terms-conditions\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.awesome-habits.com/privacy-policy\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"subscriptionHero\":{\"bgColor\":\"a953e0\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"130e09\",\"textColor2\":\"0f0e15\",\"textColor3\":\"311c34\",\"textColor4\":\"2e1c3e\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features211/v4/28/c7/10/28c7103b-84c1-6f21-8700-a23a2f7a9424/a06290ed-9e22-4793-8445-655ead75d8a0.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":4320}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":true,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":true,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"2.4\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":28782592}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878284578\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":28782592}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878284578\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com/app-privacy-policy\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-06-23\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"subtitle\":\"Simple habit \u0026 goal tracker\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Reimagined for iOS 26\\n• Enjoy a refreshed and refined look with Liquid Glass.\\n• Get habit ideas privately with Apple Intelligence (available on iOS 26, in select regions, and on supported devices).\\n• Enjoy a smoother experience when managing a large number of habits.\\n• Better accessibility: We’ve added support for high contrast mode and improved large text support.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-20T12:37:12Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"7.0.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Reimagined for iOS 26\\n• Enjoy a refreshed and refined look with Liquid Glass.\\n• Get habit ideas privately with Apple Intelligence (available on iOS 26, in select regions, and on supported devices).\\n• Enjoy a smoother experience when managing a large number of habits.\\n• Better accessibility: We’ve added support for high contrast mode and improved large text support.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-14T13:28:53Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"7.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-17T13:36:20Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-02T06:35:04Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-15T07:48:54Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-06T18:43:03Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Single habit widgets: Stay focused on what matters most with the single habit widget. Add it to your iPhone or iPad Home Screen or Lock Screen, Apple Watch face, or Mac desktop to quickly access your habit and track your progress.\\n• Improved medium-size widgets: The medium widget now supports up to 10 habits—even on smaller devices. You can also choose to show a large progress circle alongside your habits. To access this new configuration, first remove your existing widget and then add it again.\\n• Apple StoreKit 2 integration: We now use the Apple StoreKit 2 framework, which improves privacy and simplifies purchase handling in the app.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-06T06:38:30Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Autostop timers: Automatically stop the timer when the goal is reached. You can enable this in Edit habit \u003e Timer options.\\n• Add early timer alert: Get an alert before the timer goal is reached—e.g., 2 minutes early. Customize this in Edit habit \u003e Timer options.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-14T07:59:56Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Get started tips: We've added a new help section with tips and how-to guides to help new users get started.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-21T15:56:54Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-29\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Be awesome in 2025\\n• Reset habit history: Need a fresh start? Easily reset your habit history with the button on the history details screen.\\n• More start of day options: Prefer updating your progress the next morning? Set your start of day to any hour between midnight and noon.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-29T23:01:26Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Personalize your habit icons like never before. With iOS 18.2, you can set custom stickers as habit icons or take advantage of Apple Intelligence (available in supported regions and on compatible devices) to create unique Genmoji icons.\\n\\n• To maintain optimal performance and user experience on iPadOS 18, we have decided to discontinue support for the extra-large widget. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your understanding.\\n\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-13T01:09:42Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Quick actions menus: Touch and hold a habit to access quick actions like adding a custom value, adding a note, editing, archiving, and more. These quick actions are available throughout the app, including the Home tab, History tab, and calendar view. Available on iOS 17 and later.\\n• Adaptive custom repeat: For habits with a custom repeat (e.g., exercising every 3 days), the next repeats now automatically adjust based on the last completion. This ensures you maintain the intended interval, even if you complete the goal on a different day than planned.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-30T03:39:05Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-22T18:19:21Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-24\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\\n\\nCheck out all the features in our recent major update for iOS 18:\\n• Mood tracking: Track your mental wellbeing by logging your daily mood and syncing with Apple Health. Available on iOS 18.\\n• Control Center actions: Add controls to the Control Center or the bottom of your Lock Screen to quickly open a habit, start a timer, or show a habit list. Available on iOS 18.\\n• New tab bar on iPad: We've added support for the new, compact tab bar, now positioned above the app's content. Available on iPadOS 18.\\n• Tinted effect support: We've optimized widgets to look great with the new Home Screen tinted effect. Available on iOS 18.\\n• Live Activity mirroring: Start a habit timer on your iPhone, and it will automatically appear in the Smart Stack on your Apple Watch. Available on watchOS 11.\\n• Double tap gesture: Quickly complete a habit or start/stop a timer by tapping your index finger and thumb together twice. Available on Apple Watch Series 9 with watchOS 11.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-24T20:18:36Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n• Add controls to the Control Center or the bottom of your Lock Screen to quickly open a habit, start a timer, or show a habit list. Available on iOS 18.\\n\\nCheck out all the features in our previous major update for iOS 18:\\n• Mood tracking: Track your mental wellbeing by logging your daily mood and syncing with Apple Health. Available on iOS 18.\\n• New tab bar on iPad: We've added support for the new, compact tab bar, now positioned above the app's content. Available on iPadOS 18.\\n• Tinted effect support: We've optimized widgets to look great with the new Home Screen tinted effect. Available on iOS 18.\\n• Live Activity mirroring: Start a habit timer on your iPhone, and it will automatically appear in the Smart Stack on your Apple Watch. Available on watchOS 11.\\n• Double tap gesture: Quickly complete a habit or start/stop a timer by tapping your index finger and thumb together twice. Available on Apple Watch Series 9 with watchOS 11.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-18T19:12:41Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Mood tracking: Track your mental wellbeing by logging your daily mood and syncing with Apple Health. Available on iOS 18.\\n• New tab bar on iPad: We've added support for the new, compact tab bar, now positioned above the app's content. Available on iPadOS 18.\\n• Tinted effect support: We've optimized widgets to look great with the new Home Screen tinted effect. Available on iOS 18.\\n• Live Activity mirroring: Start a habit timer on your iPhone, and it will automatically appear in the Smart Stack on your Apple Watch. Available on watchOS 11.\\n• Double tap gesture: Quickly complete a habit or start/stop a timer by tapping your index finger and thumb together twice. Available on Apple Watch Series 9 with watchOS 11.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-15T20:29:19Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-11T06:59:51Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.5.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Heat maps: Get a comprehensive view of your daily habits with a 365-day heat map.\\n• Calendar view: Browse your habit history conveniently using a calendar view.\\n• Start of day: Choose your preferred start of the day to update your progress conveniently even late at night.\\n• Time Sensitive Notifications: Receive reminders on time, even in Focus Mode. Customize this feature in the system settings.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-04T07:24:00Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-02T16:05:42Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Customize sounds: Choose from 25 sounds for reminders and completed habits to personalize your experience and celebrate your achievements.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-30T08:39:09Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Habit notes timeline: View all your habit notes on a single timeline. Tap the clock icon on the habit card and switch to the Notes tab.\\n• End date for archived habits: Stopped tracking a habit but forgot to archive it? Now, you can set an end date for your archived habits.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-04T06:50:25Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-05T09:30:59Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-01\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-01T00:52:28Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy Holidays!\\n\\n• Vacation mode: Need a break before new year’s challenges? Try our new Vacation mode. It lets you pause your habits while keeping your streaks intact.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-25T14:30:18Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-13T21:03:03Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1.1\"}],\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com\"},\"osx\":{\"artwork\":{\"bgColor\":\"20201f\",\"height\":1024,\"textColor1\":\"c66cff\",\"textColor2\":\"b271e6\",\"textColor3\":\"a55cd2\",\"textColor4\":\"9561be\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/1c/0f/d6/1c0fd636-2ed9-59eb-9ce4-a757fc3f9e03/AppIcon-Dark-0-0-1x_U007euniversal-0-0-0-1-0-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1024},\"bundleId\":\"com.dreamer.Habits\",\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"mac\":[{\"bgColor\":\"fffff4\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"0d0714\",\"textColor2\":\"0d0714\",\"textColor3\":\"3d3941\",\"textColor4\":\"3d3941\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/31/85/27/318527cc-ce96-1459-b2d0-7ee474c3ae4f/1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"9658e3\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"010101\",\"textColor2\":\"020203\",\"textColor3\":\"1f122e\",\"textColor4\":\"20132f\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/37/df/05/37df05cc-55ad-741f-53e9-9640e673e932/2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"9658e3\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"07040b\",\"textColor2\":\"0f0816\",\"textColor3\":\"241536\",\"textColor4\":\"2a183f\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/ba/78/8e/ba788e98-f66b-f293-c272-11f3ed728b4e/3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"dbdbdb\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"0d0714\",\"textColor2\":\"0b0914\",\"textColor3\":\"36323c\",\"textColor4\":\"35333c\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/da/74/cf/da74cf91-9212-dfa4-1ee2-775b6b959a2a/4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"9658e3\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"020202\",\"textColor2\":\"07040b\",\"textColor3\":\"20132f\",\"textColor4\":\"241536\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/70/54/e3/7054e397-b60b-b12f-67cf-7fc566856ad2/5.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"9658e3\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"020202\",\"textColor2\":\"0f0816\",\"textColor3\":\"20132f\",\"textColor4\":\"2a183f\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/59/cd/0a/59cd0aad-4e6b-e933-b6e7-b774a6c5518f/6.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560},{\"bgColor\":\"9658e3\",\"height\":1600,\"textColor1\":\"151316\",\"textColor2\":\"141413\",\"textColor3\":\"2f213f\",\"textColor4\":\"2e213d\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/81/57/c7/8157c7ef-aad4-52a4-73f1-9a091c9b7bcf/7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2560}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Don't set goals, build habits.\\n\\nDo you remember the last time you wanted to achieve something? You may have started strong, but after some time, maybe you lost motivation. Here is our tip – instead of setting goals, start building your daily routines, and improving your regular habits. Small and easy changes will compound into remarkable results. With our app, you will get better every day and achieve the kind of success that lasts.\\n\\nBuild good habits, break bad ones.\\nWant to cut down on alcohol, improve your healthy habits, or be more productive? Possibilities are unlimited. Get inspiration from pre-defined templates, discover habit ideas with on-device Apple Intelligence (where available), or create your own custom habit.\\n\\nAchieve your daily, weekly, and monthly goals.\\nUsing a simple overview, you can easily manage all your goals and see your achievements. Have you overachieved your goal? You can track that too.\\n\\nTrack your progress and streaks.\\nBrowse history, check out your stats and see how you've improved over time.\\nDidn't have time to track a previous day? No problem, you can easily update any record in the past.\\n\\nFeatures:\\n- Build good habits, break bad ones\\n- Daily, weekly, and monthly goals\\n- Get habit ideas with private, on-device Apple Intelligence (where available)\\n- Track even overachieved goals\\n- Track time-based goals with timers\\n- Powerful statistics with heatmaps\\n- Habit lists\\n- Habit notes\\n- 2,500+ icons and emojis, with support for Genmoji and custom stickers\\n- Dark Mode and appearance customization\\n- Apple Health integration\\n- Reminders, app badge, and Apple Health notifications\\n- Interactive widgets for Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode\\n- Interactive Dynamic Island \u0026 Live Activities\\n- Control Center widgets\\n- Apple Watch complications and the Smart Stack widget\\n- Export to a CSV file\\n- Siri Shortcuts\\n- iCloud backup \u0026 sync\\n- Available on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://www.awesome-habits.com/terms-conditions\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.awesome-habits.com/privacy-policy\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"subscriptionHero\":{\"bgColor\":\"a953e0\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"130e09\",\"textColor2\":\"0f0e15\",\"textColor3\":\"311c34\",\"textColor4\":\"2e1c3e\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features211/v4/28/c7/10/28c7103b-84c1-6f21-8700-a23a2f7a9424/a06290ed-9e22-4793-8445-655ead75d8a0.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":4320}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"2.4\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":7244911}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878284869\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":7244911}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878284869\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"preflightPackageUrl\":\"https://osxapps.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Purple221/v4/be/d8/7c/bed87c7e-7fc2-dc31-255a-a76fef93e9fd/oqu2602147874216910981.pfpkg\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com/app-privacy-policy\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-06-23\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"requiresRosetta\":false,\"runsOnAppleSilicon\":true,\"runsOnIntel\":true,\"subtitle\":\"Simple habit \u0026 goal tracker\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Reimagined for macOS Tahoe\\n• Enjoy a refreshed and refined look with Liquid Glass.\\n• Get habit ideas privately with Apple Intelligence (available on macOS Tahoe, in select regions, and on supported devices).\\n• Enjoy a smoother experience when managing a large number of habits.\\n• Improved accessibility: We’ve added support for high contrast mode.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-26T05:43:01Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"7.0.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Reimagined for macOS Tahoe\\n• Enjoy a refreshed and refined look with Liquid Glass.\\n• Get habit ideas privately with Apple Intelligence (available on macOS Tahoe, in select regions, and on supported devices).\\n• Enjoy a smoother experience when managing a large number of habits.\\n• Improved accessibility: We’ve added support for high contrast mode.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-14T13:29:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"7.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-02T06:36:01Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-15T07:50:05Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-06T21:07:15Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Single habit widgets: Stay focused on what matters most with the single habit widget. Add it to your iPhone or iPad Home Screen or Lock Screen, Apple Watch face, or Mac desktop to quickly access your habit and track your progress.\\n• Improved medium-size widgets: The medium widget now supports up to 10 habits—even on smaller devices. You can also choose to show a large progress circle alongside your habits. To access this new configuration, first remove your existing widget and then add it again.\\n• Apple StoreKit 2 integration: We now use the Apple StoreKit 2 framework, which improves privacy and simplifies purchase handling in the app.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-06T06:39:05Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Autostop timers: Automatically stop the timer when the goal is reached. You can enable this in Edit habit \u003e Timer options.\\n• Add early timer alert: Get an alert before the timer goal is reached—e.g., 2 minutes early. Customize this in Edit habit \u003e Timer options.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-14T08:00:43Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Get started tips: We've added a new help section with tips and how-to guides to help new users get started.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-21T18:40:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-03\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Be awesome in 2025\\n• Reset habit history: Need a fresh start? Easily reset your habit history with the button on the history details screen.\\n• More start of day options: Prefer updating your progress the next morning? Set your start of day to any hour between midnight and noon.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-03T16:18:46Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Personalize your habit icons like never before. With macOS Sequoia 15.2, you can now use custom stickers and Genmoji created on your iPhone or iPad as habit icons.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-13T01:10:34Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Quick actions menus: Right-click (or Control-click) a habit to access quick actions like adding a custom value, adding a note, editing, archiving, and more. These quick actions are available throughout the app, including the Home tab, History tab, and calendar view. Available on macOS Sonoma and later.\\n• Adaptive custom repeat: For habits with a custom repeat (e.g., exercising every 3 days), the next repeats now automatically adjust based on the last completion. This ensures you maintain the intended interval, even if you complete the goal on a different day than planned.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-30T03:39:56Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Minor visual refresh of the macOS icon\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-22T18:19:50Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-25T07:24:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-18T19:59:35Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• We've added support for the new, compact tab bar, now positioned above the app's content. Available on macOS Sequoia.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-15T20:29:55Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"6.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-11T07:00:22Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.5.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Heat maps: Get a comprehensive view of your daily habits with a 365-day heat map.\\n• Calendar view: Browse your habit history conveniently using a calendar view.\\n• Start of day: Choose your preferred start of the day to update your progress conveniently even late at night.\\n• Time Sensitive Notifications: Receive reminders on time, even in Focus Mode. Customize this feature in the system settings.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-04T07:24:49Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-02T20:52:15Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Customize sounds: Choose from 25 sounds for reminders and completed habits to personalize your experience and celebrate your achievements.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-30T08:43:21Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Habit notes timeline: View all your habit notes on a single timeline. Click the clock icon on the habit card and switch to the Notes tab.\\n• End date for archived habits: Stopped tracking a habit but forgot to archive it? Now, you can set an end date for your archived habits.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-04T06:51:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-05T09:31:58Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-01\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-01T00:53:31Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy Holidays!\\n\\n• Vacation mode: Need a break before new year’s challenges? Try our new Vacation mode. It lets you pause your habits while keeping your streaks intact.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-25T14:31:01Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-13T21:01:47Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Add custom progress: For habits with larger goals, you can now quickly add a custom progress value directly from the habit card.\\n• Last change date: Not sure when you last updated your progress? Drag a habit card up to check the date of your last change.\\n• New Apple Health metrics: Track the time you spend in daylight to improve your physical and mental well-being (requires an Apple Watch with watchOS 10). Also, you can now track Flexibility and Mind \u0026 body workouts.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-25T18:57:04Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1\"}],\"videoPreviewsByType\