1290},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"010100\",\"textColor2\":\"32302d\",\"textColor3\":\"343433\",\"textColor4\":\"5b5957\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/63/05/f8/6305f8a7-3c0a-a4ce-314f-fbf6216f847e/ab13f64c-1acb-4351-8a8f-81535b125bd8_iPhone_14__U0026_15_Pro_Max_-_4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"070605\",\"textColor2\":\"101010\",\"textColor3\":\"383837\",\"textColor4\":\"3f3f3f\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/c2/94/d0/c294d024-7a9a-9f2d-f4d8-088558ac8cf1/b4eaf1e2-182d-4d23-8512-d02fdfac869d_iPhone_14__U0026_15_Pro_Max_-_5.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"101010\",\"textColor2\":\"2e2c29\",\"textColor3\":\"3f3f3f\",\"textColor4\":\"585654\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/e8/86/48/e88648e9-0ae4-dc28-47d9-c1b5beb278f0/f89fd770-7114-4dae-8440-5a49be96a35c_iPhone_14__U0026_15_Pro_Max_-_6.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"e6e6e6\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"2a2826\",\"textColor3\":\"2e2e2e\",\"textColor4\":\"4f4e4c\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/26/03/4b/26034bae-c4ae-9dcb-b603-6c662a78a2dc/7bda27e5-87c7-43e6-a302-1554394ffda3_iPhone_14__U0026_15_Pro_Max_-_7.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Introducing Atoms – The Official Atomic Habits App! \\n\\n## Tiny changes, remarkable results! ## \\n\\nAtoms is the definitive habits forming app inspired by the groundbreaking principles of Atomic Habits, the best-selling book by James Clear. Atoms is not only a habit tracker, but also your personal guide filled with bite-sized lessons and insightful strategies to help you make positive changes one small step at a time. \\n\\n\\n# WHY ATOMS? \\n\\n* Proven Principles: Atoms is crafted on the science-backed principles of habit change covered in Atomic Habits. You will learn how to make your habits obvious, attractive, easy, and satisfying. \\n* Five Good Minutes: Experience powerful change in just five minutes a day! Atoms is designed for everyone, including those with busy lifestyles, ensuring that you can build good habits, break bad ones, and make better decisions with minimal time investment. \\n* NYT Best-Seller: Join over 15 million people who have already embraced the transformative power of Atomic Habits. Atoms brings these life-changing principles and James Clear’s content to your fingertips in an easy-to-use app. \\n\\n\\n# KEY FEATURES: \\n\\n* Guided Habit Creation: Start small and build habits based on the kind of person you want to become. Get guidance on how to start at the right size for you. Create consistency by committing to a time and place. Build habits that last. \\n* Intuitive Interface: Enjoy a seamless user interface that makes habit tracking a joy. Visualize your progress, celebrate milestones, and stay motivated with every tiny win. \\n* Smart Reminders: Never miss a moment to invest in yourself. Atoms uses smart reminders to keep you on track and encourage consistent habit-building. \\n* Progress Insights: Gain valuable insights into your habits with detailed analytics. Track your progress over time, identify patterns, and make informed decisions for continuous improvement. \\n* Apple Watch app: Log your habits on the move\\n\\nDownload Atoms now and start experiencing the power of Atomic Habits. \\n\\nThink big. Start Small. Use Atoms.\\n\\n\\n\\nTerms and Conditions - https://www.iubenda.com/terms-and-conditions/22673733\\nPrivacy Policy - https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/22673733\\nEnd User License Agreement - https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\