Timestamp\":\"2021-02-28T15:06:54Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.41.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update improves overall performance and fixes a few pesky bugs.\\n\\nPlease let us know what you think about Habit by leaving a review! :)\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-02-16T16:19:35Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.41.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-27\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update improves overall performance and fixes a few pesky bugs.\\n\\nPlease let us know what you think about Habit by leaving a review! :)\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-27T03:16:18Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.41.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"One more update to improve the performance issue and get rid of crashes completely! \\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\nVersion 1.38-39 ( Oct 21, 2020)\\nThis update includes a list of improvements, to increase the performance of the app.  \\n\\n\\nVersion 1.37 ( Oct 3, 2020)\\nThis update includes a bunch of tiny, but very important improvements, to make your experience smooth and seamless. Also, we have added Italian localisation, shout out to Valeria Riso for helping us with it! \\n\\nPS Widget for iOS 14 is on the way, deeply working on it and will release in upcoming updates.  \\nIf you meet issues with adding “old-style” widget, here is instructions: Swipe left-\u003e Tap \\\"Edit\\\" -\u003e Press \\\"Customize\\\" -\u003e Pick the Habit widget. \\n\\n\\nVersion 1.36 ( Sep 15, 2020)\\nWhat's up? We've been working tirelessly for a while and new update is ready to be installed on your iPhones! Fire ahead, guys :)\\n\\nVersion 1.35 ( Sep 9, 2020)\\nYour complaints about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask a question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-05T20:52:46Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.40\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes a list of improvements, to increase performance of the app.  \\n\\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.37 ( Oct 3, 2020)\\nThis update includes a bunch of tiny, but very important improvements, to make your experience smooth and seamless. Also, we have added Italian localisation, shout out to Valeria Riso for helping us with it! \\n\\nPS Widget for iOS 14 is on the way, deeply working on it and will release in upcoming updates.  \\nIf you meet issues with adding “old-style” widget, here is instructions: Swipe left-\u003e Tap \\\"Edit\\\" -\u003e Press \\\"Customize\\\" -\u003e Pick the Habit widget. \\n\\n\\nVersion 1.36 ( Sep 15, 2020)\\nWhat's up? We've been working tirelessly for a while and new update is ready to be installed on your iPhones! Fire ahead, guys :)\\n\\nVersion 1.35 ( Sep 9, 2020)\\nYour complains about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\\n\\nVersion 1.34 ( Aug 4, 2020)\\nIt’s fine to make mistakes and fails. \\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com  with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-20T19:38:10Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.39\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-20\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes a list of improvements, to increase performance of the app.  \\n\\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.37 ( Oct 3, 2020)\\nThis update includes a bunch of tiny, but very important improvements, to make your experience smooth and seamless. Also, we have added Italian localisation, shout out to Valeria Riso for helping us with it! \\n\\nPS Widget for iOS 14 is on the way, deeply working on it and will release in upcoming updates.  \\nIf you meet issues with adding “old-style” widget, here is instructions: Swipe left-\u003e Tap \\\"Edit\\\" -\u003e Press \\\"Customize\\\" -\u003e Pick the Habit widget. \\n\\n\\nVersion 1.36 ( Sep 15, 2020)\\nWhat's up? We've been working tirelessly for a while and new update is ready to be installed on your iPhones! Fire ahead, guys :)\\n\\nVersion 1.35 ( Sep 9, 2020)\\nYour complains about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\\n\\nVersion 1.34 ( Aug 4, 2020)\\nIt’s fine to make mistakes and fails. \\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com  with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-20T03:10:23Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.38\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-03\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes a bunch of tiny, but very important improvements, to make your experience smooth and seamless. Also, we have added Italian localisation, shout out to Valeria Riso for helping us with it! \\n\\nPS Widget for iOS 14 is on the way, deeply working on it and will release in upcoming updates.  \\nIf you meet issues with adding “old-style” widget, here is instructions: Swipe left-\u003e Tap \\\"Edit\\\" -\u003e Press \\\"Customize\\\" -\u003e Pick the Habit widget. \\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.36 ( Sep 15, 2020)\\nWhat's up? We've been working tirelessly for a while and new update is ready to be installed on your iPhones! Fire ahead, guys :)\\n\\nVersion 1.35 ( Sep 9, 2020)\\nYour complains about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\\n\\nVersion 1.34 ( Aug 4, 2020)\\nIt’s fine to make mistakes and fails. \\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com  with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\\n\\nVersion 1.33 ( Jul 13, 2020)\\nIt Never Gets Easier, You Just Get Better! \\nHappy to announce the release of a long-waiting feature - Dark Mode! \\nThe feature is available for all current and feature Premium users, hurry up to upgrade your profile! \\n\\nNo subscriptions. You only pay once and all premium features forever yours! \\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-03T14:21:18Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.37\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-09-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's up? We've been working tirelessly for a while and new update is ready to be installed on your iPhones! Fire ahead, guys :)\\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.35 ( Sep 9, 2020)\\nYour complains about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\\n\\nVersion 1.34 ( Aug 4, 2020)\\nIt’s fine to make mistakes and fails. \\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com  with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\\n\\nVersion 1.33 ( Jul 13, 2020)\\nIt Never Gets Easier, You Just Get Better! \\nHappy to announce the release of a long-waiting feature - Dark Mode! \\nThe feature is available for all current and feature Premium users, hurry up to upgrade your profile! \\n\\nNo subscriptions. You only pay once and all premium features forever yours! \\n\\nVersion 1.32 ( May 27, 2020)\\nWe have updated menu to make it more visually clear, also this update includes fixes, improvements and updates! \\n\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-09-15T03:00:29Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.36\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-09-09\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Your complains about crushes and issue with notifications are heard! We fix all of it in the new Habit Tracker's version. So, update and enjoy!\\n\\nAlso, feel free to ask question or share your concerns at hi.habittracker@gmail.com!\\n\\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\nVersion 1.34 ( Aug 4, 2020)\\nIt’s fine to make mistakes and fails. \\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com  with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\\n\\nVersion 1.33 ( Jul 13, 2020)\\nIt Never Gets Easier, You Just Get Better! \\nHappy to announce the release of a long-waiting feature - Dark Mode! \\nThe feature is available for all current and feature Premium users, hurry up to upgrade your profile! \\n\\nNo subscriptions. You only pay once and all premium features forever yours! \\n\\nVersion 1.32 ( May 27, 2020)\\nWe have updated menu to make it more visually clear, also this update includes fixes, improvements and updates! \\n\\nVersion 1.31 ( May 2, 2020)\\nThank you all for your feedback, ideas and bug reports! This update contains a bunch of long-waiting updates.  changes that most of you wait.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-09-09T22:25:20Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.35\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-08-04\",\"releaseNotes\":\"It’s fine to make mistakes and fails.\\nWe did a mistake. In the last update appeared a bug where today’s date was updated with delay. Take our apologies for the inconvenience. We made required fixes, properly tested it and glad to delivery update for you!\\n\\nTo avoid such bad stories in a future, help us improve product - join beta testing! Drop us a line at hi.habittracker@gmail.com with topic \\\"Join Beta\\\"\\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.33 ( Jul 13, 2020)\\nIt Never Gets Easier, You Just Get Better!\\nHappy to announce the release of a long-waiting feature - Dark Mode!\\nThe feature is available for all current and feature Premium users, hurry up to upgrade your profile!\\n\\nNo subscriptions. You only pay once and all premium features forever yours!\\n\\nVersion 1.32 ( May 27, 2020)\\nWe have updated menu to make it more visually clear, also this update includes fixes, improvements and updates!\\n\\nVersion 1.31 ( May 2, 2020)\\nThank you all for your feedback, ideas and bug reports! This update contains a bunch of long-waiting updates. changes that most of you wait.\\n\\nVersion 1.30 (April 20, 2020)\\n• Improvement: the menu was updated to make user experience more smooth and clean.\\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, improvements, and updates.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-08-04T05:37:51Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.34\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-07-13\",\"releaseNotes\":\"It Never Gets Easier, You Just Get Better! \\nHappy to announce the release of a long-waiting feature - Dark Mode! \\nThe feature is available for all current and feature Premium users, hurry up to upgrade your profile! \\n\\nNo subscriptions. You only pay once and all premium features forever yours! \\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.32 ( May 27, 2020)\\nWe have updated menu to make it more visually clear, also this update includes fixes, improvements and updates! \\n\\nVersion 1.31 ( May 2, 2020)\\nThank you all for your feedback, ideas and bug reports! This update contains a bunch of long-waiting updates.  changes that most of you wait.\\n\\nVersion 1.30 (April 20, 2020)\\n• Improvement: the menu was updated to make user experience more smooth and clean. \\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, improvements, and updates.\\n\\nVersion 1.29 (Jan 31, 2020)\\n• Improvement: create / edit habit screen update. The colour selection became more accessible. \\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, minor improvements, and updates.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-07-13T22:14:19Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.33\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-05-27\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have updated menu to make it more visually clear, also this update includes fixes, improvements and updates! \\n\\n===== Previous Updates =====\\n\\nVersion 1.31 ( May 2, 2020)\\nThank you all for your feedback, ideas and bug reports! This update contains a bunch of long-waiting updates.  changes that most of you wait.\\n\\nVersion 1.30 (April 20, 2020)\\n• Improvement: the menu was updated to make user experience more smooth and clean. \\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, improvements, and updates.\\n\\nVersion 1.29 (Jan 31, 2020)\\n• Improvement: create / edit habit screen update. The colour selection became more accessible. \\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, minor improvements, and updates.\\n\\nVersion 1.28 (Dec 28, 2019)\\n• Improvement: performance optimization works, minor improvements, and updates.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-05-27T08:06:55Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"1.32\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2020-05-02\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Thank you all for your feedback, ideas and bug reports! This update contains a bunch of long-waiting updates.  changes that most of you wait.\\n\\n===== 