ps, read, meditate, drink water, wake up early, sleep early, journal, brush teeth, cook, quit smoking, quit drinking, quit social media, quit skin picking, and more.\\nSuggestions: Explore hundreds of habit ideas for your list, including fitness, health, productivity, and wellness goals.\\nGoals: Set daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly targets to achieve your desired outcomes.\\nReminders: Set up multiple reminders per habit to stay on track and build consistency.\\nActivity Entries: Log unlimited activities for past or current dates to monitor your progress.\\nStreaks and Stats: Track your progress with detailed streaks, statistics, and records to stay motivated.\\nTimers: Stay focused with stopwatch or countdown timers for time-bound habits.\\nHealth Sync: Automatically sync health-related habits with Apple Health for comprehensive tracking.\\nQuit Trackers: Monitor the duration since quitting habits to celebrate milestones.\\n\\nJOURNAL\\nDetailed Notes: Record insights and progress for each habit to reflect on your journey.\\nRich Text Editor: Customize notes with formatting and styles for better organization.\\nCentralized View: Access habit activity and notes in one place for easy reference.\\nFiltering: Organize journal entries by habit to review specific areas of focus.\\nBookmarking: Mark important notes for quick reference and easy access.\\n\\nSCHEDULE\\nReminder Options: Set one-time, daily, weekly, or monthly reminders to keep your habits top of mind.\\nUnlimited Reminders: Add as many reminders as needed for each habit to stay consistent.\\nCalendar View: Check your schedule in daily, weekly, or monthly formats to plan ahead effectively.\\n\\nPLATFORM\\nDark Mode: Try out a sleek, dark interface for comfortable nighttime use.\\nCustomization: Personalize various settings to suit your preferences and needs.\\nSync Across Devices: Access your data seamlessly on all your devices for convenience.\\nCustomer Support: Get help via an in-app chat feature for quick assistance.\\n\\nHelloHabit offers all features for free within the following limits:\\n- 5 total active habits\\n- 1 reminder per habit\\n- 3 journal notes per day\\n\\nHelloHabit Premium offers unlimited access. Start a free trial for an ongoing subscription or make a one-time payment for lifetime access. Country-specific pricing is visible within the app!\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://hellohabit.com/terms\\nPrivacy Policy: https://hellohabit.com/privacy\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":37722859}],\"buyParams\":\"produc