425770\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f2/6c/cf/f26ccff5-0ef9-41d2-890e-73f60f257cea/6.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"09264a\",\"textColor2\":\"01295a\",\"textColor3\":\"3a516e\",\"textColor4\":\"34547b\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/a4/f0/25/a4f025c8-376f-1497-25ff-0898e8a61f05/7.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"ffffff\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"0a274a\",\"textColor2\":\"1d3551\",\"textColor3\":\"3b526e\",\"textColor4\":\"4a5d74\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/25/d8/9e/25d89e90-608b-6d6f-ae44-26d534b10b2b/8.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"1857a5\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"e5f6ef\",\"textColor2\":\"eeedef\",\"textColor3\":\"bcd7e0\",\"textColor4\":\"c3cfe0\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/7b/29/36/7b29369e-0435-1cfe-3b8c-9b8cb66a03ae/9.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290},{\"bgColor\":\"1857a6\",\"height\":2796,\"textColor1\":\"fbd0b0\",\"textColor2\":\"febc96\",\"textColor3\":\"ceb8ae\",\"textColor4\":\"d0a899\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/3e/06/10/3e0610e7-42ab-d7c0-d5e9-2057d2fd2870/10.jpg/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1290}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}},\"default\":{\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"mac\":[{\"bgColor\":\"1857a3\",\"height\":1800,\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"8be2af\",\"textColor3\":\"d0ddec\",\"textColor4\":\"74c6ac\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/db/d3/ec/dbd3ecaf-ccab-6b89-cea8-ff227f97f8d2/90320624-479a-4abb-89c5-bd6a594eb940_Mac-1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2880},{\"bgColor\":\"1857a3\",\"height\":1800,\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"dde4e0\",\"textColor3\":\"d0ddec\",\"textColor4\":\"b6c8d4\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/56/be/8f/56be8fdc-9bbb-89ea-75df-9c972a11ec25/3db95c6a-ef6c-4093-b8d3-f3b0c67b21ba_Mac-2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2880},{\"bgColor\":\"1857a3\",\"height\":1800,\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e0e7\",\"textColor3\":\"d0ddec\",\"textColor4\":\"bcc5d9\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/47/8f/f4/478ff437-855c-1047-9a83-c7e0d57aae19/f20cfa3c-636a-497a-9679-a2a9f9bf7553_Mac-3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":2880}]},\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{}}}},\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Imagine having all of your most important habits, routines and goals together in one simple to do list. Now you can! With Strides, you can track good or bad habits, SMART goals, and more. Keep up with reminders to hold you accountable and charts to keep you motivated. Explore new ways to manage your life with over 150 templates and the ability to create your own trackers.\\n\\nGet organized with a daily checklist to help create your perfect routine. Keep up with what you’ve accomplished with progress reports that compile your goals, projects and progress all in one place. Set up reminders and add notes to ensure you’re on track and on task. \\n\\nTrack anything you want with four types of trackers. Streak calendars let you keep up with your success rate, and milestone calendars help you to keep up with project timelines. Want to keep track of a repeating number? Check out the Average tracker. Looking to hit a goal by a specific date? Give the Target tracker a try.\\n\\nStart keeping track of your habits and goals anywhere you go. Download today to get organized and create the perfect routine with Strides.\\n\\nTRACKERS:\\n- 150+ templates to choose from, or create your own customized tracker\\n- Progress Reports with everything in one place\\n- View charts with history, streak, success rate and more\\n- Unlimited reminders to set yourself up for success\\n\\nADDITIONAL FEATURES:\\n- Integration with Apple Health\\n- Sync between iPhone, iPad \u0026 Mac\\n- Add notes to logs and trackers\\n- Reminders to keep you on track\\n\\nSEE WHAT OTHERS ARE SAYING:\\n\\\"I just wanted to say a big THANK YOU! Strides is one of the most useful apps out there. Nowadays, I can't even imagine myself without it :)” ~Leyla\\n\\n\\\"Amazing app. The sheer amount of flexibility with what you can track with Strides is amazing.\\\" ~Carlo\\n\\n\\\"My life has become so much more organized and fulfilled since I started using your app. I really appreciate it!” ~Micah\\n\\n\\\"Best tracking app. I love, love, love this app! This is exactly what I've been looking for for two or three years. I can track multiple goals and see them all on one screen. Perfect!\\\" ~Kate\\n\\n–\\n\\nStrides is free forever to track what's most important to you. If you want to get even more out of it and support development, you can upgrade to Strides Plus with a monthly or annual subscription - or with a one-time purchase of the lifetime plan - to unlock all premium features, including Unlimited Trackers, sync between iPhone, iPad \u0026 Mac, Tags \u0026 Filters, Today List, Export Data, Goal Notes and more.\\n\\nPayment will be charged to the credit card connected to your iTunes Account when you confirm the initial subscription purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current subscription period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and the cost of the renewal will be identified. You may manage your subscription and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your Account Settings after the purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription, where applicable.\\n\\n–\\n\\nRead our full Privacy Policy / Terms of Use:\\nhttps://www.stridesapp.com/privacy.html\\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\n\\nKeep making strides!\"},\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1080},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"height\":1080,\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":1048},\"originalFlowcaseBrick\":{\"bgColor\":\"003e7a\",\"height\":600,\"textColor1\":\"99caf7\",\"textColor2\":\"82bff7\",\"textColor3\":\"7baede\",\"textColor4\":\"68a5de\",\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features4/v4/11/ab/c1/11abc160-0904-ae36-329c-2d5ab7ca9fc8/mza_7202234103757208420.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"width\":3200}},\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"offers\":[{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":31786134}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=672401817\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878633663\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"get\"},{\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":31786134}],\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=672401817\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=878633663\",\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"price\":0,\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"type\":\"update\"}],\"preflightPackageUrl\":\"https://osxapps.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Purple211/v4/a8/a4/ab/a8a4abe2-2705-a13a-05ef-3c5fc8df0469/wad13926673580535561332.pfpkg\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.stridesapp.com/privacy.html\",\"releaseDate\":\"2013-07-22\",\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"requires32bit\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"requiresRosetta\":false,\"runsOnAppleSilicon\":true,\"runsOnIntel\":true,\"subtitle\":\"Goal Planner \u0026 Daily Checklist\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.stridesapp.com/help/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Swiping to log on the Progress Report now comes with a nice bar animation. We did more prep work for the design refresh and fixed a couple bugs. Can't wait for you to see what  we've been working on!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-10-05T04:06:59Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.7\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Preparing for design improvements. Fixes for widgets, notifications and caching.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-22T09:43:48Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-09-09\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New: Quarterly Goals! Now you can track Habit, Average and Apple Health trackers by quarter too.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-09-09T20:17:07Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Have you tried the new Accountability feature? Now you can share your goals with accountability partners and even collaborate to make progress together! Just tap Accountability to share a goal with someone.\\n\\nChanges:\\n- Logging from a notification on a past date logs now backlogs on that date\\n- Habit trackers with Log with Note enabled always have the keyboard up right away now\\n- Fixed a bug causing trackers marked for deletion to count toward the limit\\n- Fixed a rare bug with notifications\\n- Fixed a rare crashing bug\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-21T13:07:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Quick fix for notification issue.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-11T19:59:42Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update is focused on performance improvements, especially for people with lots of data. Also sped up the privacy lock screen.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-08-10T04:02:38Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Have you tried the new Accountability feature? Now you can share your goals with accountability partners and even collaborate to make progress together! Just tap Accountability to share a goal with someone.\\n\\nThis update fixes some rare bugs related to the new feature.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-18T02:41:26Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.1.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Have you tried the new Accountability feature? Now you can share your goals with accountability partners and even collaborate to make progress together!\\n\\nFixed a bug with the Privacy Lock feature and made it faster to undo a habit log by not requiring a confirmation unless there's a note.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-16T18:51:33Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"NEW: Accountability and Collaboration! Now you can share your goals to team up with accountability partners and even collaborate to make progress together. This is the most popular feature request so we spent a long time carefully designing and building it to be easy to use and as valuable as possible. Viewing other people's progress is as easy as using the Shared With Me filter on Reports, and you can schedule accountability partner reminders to jump straight in to see how they're doing. We're so excited to get this launched!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-07-14T04:05:28Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"18.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Minor improvements preparing for a big new feature coming soon!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-06-23T12:10:47Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.9\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Minor fixes and icon adjustment\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-14T17:37:45Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.8\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We're making great progress on the the next major feature! In the meantime, this release has a few tweaks and fixes, including a UI fix for the log no button not showing up correctly in dark mode in some cases. Can't wait to show you the big new feature we're working on!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-05-11T04:01:02Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.7\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-06\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed keyboard disappearing bug and a few crashes. Improved calendar date pickers and duplicated tracker start dates.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-06T04:00:47Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.6\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-09\",\"releaseNotes\":\"How has 2025 been so far? Hope you're making progress on your goals and building some healthy habits.\\n\\nThis update fixes a few minor bugs and improves large number abbreviation in the Progress widgets. Keep making strides!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-09T05:00:43Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.5\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-19\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Hope 2025 is off to a great start for you!\\n\\nThis update has some small fixes. We're still making great progress on the next major feature release!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-19T05:01:39Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy New Year! Hope you have a great start to 2025.\\n\\nThis is a small update with some fixes and to prepare for some big features we're working on for next year.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-15T05:01:09Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-05\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Removed launch screen animation to save time for people that force-quit the app between each use.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-05T19:55:05Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-16\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Brand new onboarding and tutorial for new users and animated launch screen. 17.1 includes fixes for some rare onboarding issues and for a date issue when resizing the app window on Mac.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-16T18:30:12Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-14\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Brand new onboarding and tutorial for new users and animated launch screen. Also fixed Due Today widget's Morning routine filter and optimized dark mode icon.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-14T04:01:17Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"17.0\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-15\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added dark mode icon and tinted icon to make it any color you want to match the rest of your home screen.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-15T04:00:32Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.4.3\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-31\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed: Perfect day and done for today congrats popups weren't showing properly. Sorry about that. Keep making strides!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-31T04:01:27Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.4.2\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-18\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Have you tried the new Progress Widgets? Keep your most important goals top of mind with progress bars on your home screen.\\n\\nThis update has improvements for the Trends Report, Target daily goal formula and reminders, along with several fixes.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-18T04:00:52Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.4.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"NEW: Progress Widgets! Keep track of your most important goals and habits with progress bars right from your home screen.\\n\\nAlso added new Done for Today congrats popup with a quick report on how you many habits you completed today, and a right-click option for Habits in Due called Add Note so you don't have to scroll down and add a note after logging.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-11T04:00:57Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.4\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-07\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixes for sleep tracking issue caused by overlapping data from multiple sources, reminder times changing after traveling between time zones, and a daylight savings time issue.\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-07T04:00:46Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.3.1\"},{\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-09\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We're almost halfway through the year. Hope your 2024 goals are on track! Average trackers with a goal of X or less now show a green progress bar when under the goal for all Progress Report settings. Also fixed bugs with trackers repeating every X weeks, deleting milestones with subtasks not syncing and a crash when reordering trackers. Keep making strides!\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-09T04:01:28Z\",\"versionDisplay\":\"16.3\"}],\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.stridesapp.com\"}},\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}],\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\"}]},\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 16.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 16.0 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"r